---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/ai.css';
---

<Layout
  title="A.I. — Rycode"
  description="How the models actually work. New pieces appear here as rows."
  variant="ai"
>
  <div slot="ai-identity" class="ai-identity-block">
    <h1 class="ai-identity">
      <img class="ai-glyph" src="/landing/hub-brain-overhead.webp" alt="" width="63" height="72" />
      A.I.
    </h1>
  </div>

  <section class="ai-bench" id="aiBench" hidden aria-labelledby="ai-bench-heading">
    <div class="ai-bench-plate">
      <p class="ai-bench-kicker">Rycode · /ai · bench table · lane B</p>
      <h2 class="ai-bench-title" id="ai-bench-heading">Highest-reasoning / flagship by lab</h2>
      <p class="ai-bench-sub" data-ai-bench-asof>Shared benches · living pack</p>
      <p class="ai-bench-read">Blanks mean no shared primary for that cell; bench versions differ by lab. AA Index is Artificial Analysis (v4.3.2), independent, not a lab announce score.</p>
      <div class="ai-bench-wrap">
        <table class="ai-bench-table">
          <thead></thead>
          <tbody></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="ai-bench-feed">Feed ships as <code>public/ai-benchmarks.json</code></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline src="/ai-benchmarks.js" defer></script>

  <section class="ai-band" aria-labelledby="ai-labs">
    <h2 class="ai-section-label" id="ai-labs">Labs</h2>
    <div class="ai-lab-list">
      <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/anthropic/">
        <span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-title">Anthropic</span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">Claude frontier lineup.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/openai/">
        <span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-title">OpenAI</span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">GPT frontier lineup.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/xai/">
        <span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-title">xAI</span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">Grok frontier lineup.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/google/">
        <span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-title">Google</span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">Gemini / Gemma lineup.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/meta/">
        <span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-title">Meta</span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">Muse and Llama stacks.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/deepseek/">
        <span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-title">DeepSeek</span>
          <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">V4 Flash and Pro API line.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ai-band ai-papers" aria-labelledby="ai-papers">
    <h2 class="ai-section-label" id="ai-papers">Labs &amp; papers</h2>
    <p class="ai-papers-kicker">Lab homes</p>
    <nav class="ai-papers-homes" aria-label="Lab homes">
      <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/">Anthropic</a>
      <a href="https://openai.com/">OpenAI</a>
      <a href="https://x.ai/">xAI</a>
      <a href="https://deepmind.google/">Google</a>
      <a href="https://ai.meta.com/">Meta</a>
      <a href="https://www.deepseek.com/">DeepSeek</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="ai-papers-kicker">New releases</p>
    <ul class="ai-papers-chips">
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/claude-opus-5-5">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">Claude Opus 5.5</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">blog</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/fc1b44717c85dc068bc6ba5024219938094694bd/Claude%20Opus%205.5%20System%20Card.pdf">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">Opus 5.5 System Card</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">System Card</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://artificialanalysis.ai/articles/claude-opus-5-5">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">AA Opus 5.5</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">AA</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-sol">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">GPT-6 Sol and Luna</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">docs</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://artificialanalysis.ai/articles/gpt-6-sol-and-luna-push-the-cost-efficiency-frontier">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">AA Sol and Luna</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">AA</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/news/latest/v2-6">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">MiMo-V2.6</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">blog</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://huggingface.co/collections/XiaomiMiMo/mimo-v26">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">MiMo-V2.6 weights</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">HF</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://artificialanalysis.ai/leaderboards/models">
          <time class="ai-papers-chip-date" datetime="2026-09-22">22 Sep</time>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-title">AA Grok 4.7</span>
          <span class="ai-papers-chip-source">AA</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="ai-band" aria-labelledby="ai-open-weight">
    <h2 class="ai-section-label" id="ai-open-weight">Open weight</h2>
    <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/open-weight/">
      <span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-title">Open-weight frontier</span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">Downloadable weights near the closed frontier. Llama stays under Meta.</span>
      </span>
      <span class="ai-open-chip">5 models</span>
      <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="ai-band" aria-labelledby="ai-system-one">
    <h2 class="ai-section-label" id="ai-system-one">System One</h2>
    <a class="ai-lab-card" href="/ai/models/typesafe/jev/">
      <span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-title">TypeSafe · Jev</span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">Typed decisions for software, not a chat flagship.</span>
      </span>
      <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="ai-hardware" aria-labelledby="ai-hardware">
    <h2 class="ai-kicker" id="ai-hardware">Hardware</h2>
    <a class="ai-lab-card ai-hardware-card" href="/ai/hardware/">
      <span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-title">Hardware</span>
        <span class="ai-lab-card-dek">Fab ≠ campus — Terafab (chip fab) vs Colossus (training campus).</span>
      </span>
      <span class="ai-lab-card-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="ai-band ai-dive-band" aria-labelledby="ai-deep-dive">
    <h2 class="ai-section-label" id="ai-deep-dive">Deep dive</h2>
    <ol class="ai-dive">
      <li>
        <a href="/ai/chat-models-write-strings-system-one-returns-decisions/">
          <time class="ai-dive-date" datetime="2026-09-20">20 Sep 2026</time>
          <span class="ai-dive-title">Chat models write strings. System One returns typed decisions.</span>
          <span class="ai-dive-dek">Why Jev changes the scoreboard for software automation</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/ai/ten-thousand-agents-is-not-a-genius/">
          <time class="ai-dive-date" datetime="2026-09-13">13 Sep 2026</time>
          <span class="ai-dive-title">The claimed math breakthrough was agent scale and token spend</span>
          <span class="ai-dive-dek">Ten thousand agents is not a genius</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/ai/next-token-engine/">
          <time class="ai-dive-date" datetime="2026-08-25">25 Aug 2026</time>
          <span class="ai-dive-title">A next-token engine with an RLVR post-train and a tool loop.</span>
          <span class="ai-dive-dek">How staged training and tools shape a next-token engine.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</Layout>
